    <!-- TODO.md #79: quick-fix (lightbulb) menu item icon — a hammer, per the user's own request
         ("как в Rider" — Rider/ReSharper-style, one uniform icon for every fix action, see TODO #79's
         reasoning on why a single icon suffices today). Hand-drawn as two crossed rectangles (a head
         perpendicular to a diagonal handle), NOT sourced from Material Design Icons — no exact
         "hammer" glyph from that library was available/verified here, so this is a plain original
         pictogram sized to the same 24×24 viewbox as the rest of this file, rendered/checked at both
         full size and 16px before being committed. -->
